<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: Material Symbols, Rounded style, filled (Apache-2.0, info/LICENSE-material-symbols.txt). Since the
    Chapter 5 menus the Fortnite lobby draws chunky solid glyphs with rounded ends (navbar grid and search, sidebar
    friends, settings gear, menu bars); Rounded filled is the closest open set. The game's own icons are Epic's
    artwork and are not bundled. icons.json lists every source. The paths are the SVGs' own, moved from 0,-960 onto
    a 0..960 grid.

    One geometry per role Playnite's chrome needs (Icon + role), plus the dropdown, submenu and check indicators and the
    game page icons, drawn by IconTemplate in the inherited foreground. IconMainMenu is the three bars the game's
    sidebar uses for its game menu; Library is the home glyph, Options the settings gear.

    Menu icons (main menu, game menu) are theme file paths: Playnite's MenuHelpers.GetIcon loads a string resource as an
    image through ThemeFile. Images/Material holds them at 48px in white, the favorite star in the PLAY yellow and quit
    and remove in the danger red.
-->
